<title>POLAND: Prochnik plans no 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Prochnik plans no 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish garment maker Prochnik SA plans no 1996 dividend and wants to earmark the entire 140,000 zloty net profit for dividend, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The management's proposal will be voted on the firm's general shareholders meeting on June 19.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
